&lt;p&gt;Our semiconductor MEMS programmable solutions offer a rich feature set that enables customers to differentiate their products with higher performance, smaller size, lower power, and better reliability. With more than 4 billion devices shipped, SiTime is changing the timing industry. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?da

